profile: tinyrustlm-mirust.decisions.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T20:20:00Z

current_decisions:
  - Keep TinyRustLM.MiRust.com as the plain-PHP current developer portal.
  - Use only the clean-slate six-member SLM2 contract; preserve superseded material solely as labeled historical evidence.
  - Keep the default three-package transaction separate from the optional TinyRustLM.MemoryEndpoints connector.
  - Define MemoryEndpoints.com as two isolated uses: direct ecosystem-agent coordination and the TinyRustLM.com Connect user plugin.
  - Permit redundant prelaunch memory only with active synchronization, provenance, secret safety, and conflict reconciliation.
  - Bind every release claim to clean pushed source, deterministic artifacts, deployment receipt, and exact HTTPS readback.
